Show exits and which networks use them

Usage:
  olr routing show [flags]
  olr routing show [command]

Available Commands:
  exit        Show one exit in full
  exits       List the ways out of this box
  traffic     Show how much each device has used, and through which way out

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for show

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr routing show [command] --help" for more information about a command.
